⍝ ---- relations.  The precision schedule: 8 terms, then 24 (easy separations are found early; an undecided relation stops at 24).
sched ∶ 𝔏 ℕ
sched ≔ (∷ 111000000 (∷ 110011000000 ⊥))
⍝ x = 0:  proved when the normal form is 0;  refuted when a certified disc excludes 0
eqᴾ ∶ 𝔏 α → 𝔒
eqᴾ ξ ≔ ((∅ ξ) ⋗ (foldr (υ ι ↦ ((∧ (◀ υ) (≻ (𝒩 (◀ (▶ υ))) (⊠ (▶ (▶ υ)) (▶ (▶ υ))))) ⋖ ι)) ≖ (encᴾ ξ)))
⍝ the sign of a real x from certified discs:  ⋗ positive, ⋖ negative, ≖ not decided
sgnᴾ ∶ 𝔏 α → 𝔒
sgnᴾ ξ ≔ (foldr (υ ι ↦ ((◀ υ) ((φ ψ ↦ ((≻ (⊟ (ℜ φ) ψ) 0) ⋗ ((≺ (⊞ (ℜ φ) ψ) 0) ⋖ ι))) (◀ (▶ υ)) (▶ (▶ υ))) ι)) ≖ (encᴾ ξ))
⍝ ---- formulas: and = min, or = max, not = reverse on ⋖ < ≖ < ⋗;  values are decided directly
fo ∶ 𝔏 (𝔓 𝔇 𝔔) → 𝔇 → 𝔔 → 𝔒
